          "t": "text",
          "v": "Last updated: 13 September 2026"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "4e837719de26e3c1",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This records what has changed in the toolkit, and where the Google Drive copy and this markdown copy differ."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "fc43c981fac7676c",
      "id": "intro.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "There are two copies of this toolkit:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "40c639a91358a33a",
      "id": "intro.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "03d87cbabf4c6e9b",
      "id": "intro.4",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "This markdown set"
              }
            ],
            "t": "strong"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " (the zip). The source of truth. Plain text, nothing lost in conversion."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "The Google Drive set."
              }
            ],
            "t": "strong"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 34 documents and 2 spreadsheets, fully interlinked."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": false
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The Drive connector can create documents but cannot edit an existing one. So when the markdown changes, the Drive copy needs a manual paste. This file tracks that gap."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "7a9045fed5712aec",
      "id": "intro.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
      "id": "intro.6",
      "kind": "hr"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Change 1: shortcut path for people whose name is already decided"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "414a5a7113cb2778",
      "id": "change-1-shortcut-path-for-people-whose-name-is-already-decided",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Change 1: shortcut path for people whose name is already decided"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Date:"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 13 September 2026"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Reason:"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " The branding sequence assumed every reader was starting from nothing. Someone with a registered name was being sent through a naming prompt and a naming-focused competitor scan they did not need."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "5d972578e8525e59",
      "id": "change-1-shortcut-path-for-people-whose-name-is-already-decided.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Added"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 3,
      "hash": "f1ad429536dd7fe4",
      "id": "added",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Added"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Already have your name (shortcut)"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "branding/already-have-your-name",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " — new file, about 1,200 words."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "85169cf8ad410c0d",
      "id": "added.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "What it does:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "1f8ec9add66fff28",
      "id": "added.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "6a7ecc453fa11184",
      "id": "added.3",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Maps all 12 branding prompts to skip / modify / still do. The answer is: "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "skip one, modify one, do the other nine."
              }
            ],
            "t": "strong"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Supplies a replacement for Prompt 2 that drops naming patterns and adds two questions the original never asked: what does my name already suggest visually, and does it create visual constraints (too long for a vehicle door, awkward at small sizes, hard to set in type)."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Records the three checks still worth doing when a company name is registered: domain and handles, CIPC trade mark search, and saying the name aloud to speakers of the relevant languages."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Explains that a CIPC company name protects nothing in the market."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Repeats the section 32 requirement, which now applies because the name is registered."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": false
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Status in Drive:"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " DONE. Created as \"00 Already have your name - start here in this folder\" in the 02 Branding and marketing folder."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "3fdb7410a18803be",
      "id": "added.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
