      "hash": "ef121f8d093a17ce",
      "id": "change-3-missing-entry-document-in-the-core-folder-fix",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Change 3: missing entry document in the Core folder (fix)"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Date:"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 14 September 2026"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Reason:"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " A numbering error, spotted by the user. In Drive the 01 Core folder ran 02 to 09 with no 01, because "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Core: start here"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "core/start-here",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " had been folded into the root START HERE when Drive was built. The result looked like a missing file, and it left Core as the only folder without its own entry document. Every other folder has one."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "abf6f25be5dee74d",
      "id": "change-3-missing-entry-document-in-the-core-folder-fix.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
