          "t": "text",
          "v": "Drive document \"01 Start here - what is in this folder\" in the 01 Core folder. It carries the reading order, a table of the eight core documents with when to read each, which ones apply to which readers, and a short note explaining that the numbering starts at 02 because this document is 01."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "fc75dcc02abd4b10",
      "id": "added-2.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "It is deliberately not a copy of the root START HERE. Root START HERE indexes the whole toolkit; this one orients you inside the Core folder."
        }
      ],
