      "hash": "f1e05caa50e1ad35",
      "id": "how-to-keep-the-two-copies-in-sync.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "For a full rewrite of one document, open the existing Google Doc, select all, delete, and paste the new content. The ID survives because the file does."
        }
